      "semanticConstraints": [
        "Root and Manifest must resolve to admitted contained local read-only paths; symlinks and traversal reject.",
        "Exact manifest SHA256, current revision and runtime publication/asset identities must agree before endpoint registration. Metadata export does not read deployment assets.",
        "PagePath must be a fixed local absolute route; source validators govern safe manifest and aggregate retained byte admission.",
        "PagePath and explicit Routes cannot both be configured. Explicit empty/null Routes, unknown settings, duplicate route IDs/paths, unsafe paths, unknown revisions and policies reject activation.",
        "Authenticated resources require the independently selected Foundation BFF-cookie feature. Bootstrap cannot weaken Page admission and inherits its permission in addition to any bootstrap permission.",
        "Explicit route bootstrap URLs partition route ID and selected revision hash. Legacy revision-only aliases are not registered in explicit mode. Assets remain explicitly public and must contain no private data."
      ],
